  "item": "R1",
  "scores": {"U": 2, "A": 2, "C": 3, "V": 1},
  "confidences": {"U": 0.9, "A": 0.95, "C": 0.8, "V": 0.95},
  "rationales": {"U":"原文'Only those conditions expressed with the imperative \"shall\" are to be interpreted as binding requirements'未明确定义'conditions'指代对象（是自然语言句子？SRS中所有含shall的语句？还是仅指需求条目？），且'binding requirements for this SRS'未说明约束范围（是否涵盖接口、设计约束、质量属性等），导致读者需外部知识推断适用边界，违反可理解性；","A":"'Only those conditions expressed with the imperative \"shall\"'存在歧义：'expressed with'未区分语法形式（如被动式shall be delivered）与语义意图（是否所有shall均自动升格为 binding？是否允许shall not？是否排除shall be able to等弱化表达？），且'are to be interpreted as'引入解释性而非规范性表述，削弱强制力定义；","C":"该条目本身不描述系统行为或属性，而是元规则（meta-rule），属于SRS编写规范而非功能/非功能需求，因此在SRS内容正确性层面属合理元声明，但未说明其与IEEE/ISO标准的一致性依据，故正确性得分中等；","V":"无法通过测试验证——'interpreted as binding requirements'是主观认知过程，无可观测输出或判定准则；无法设计测试用例证明某条语句是否被'interpreted as binding'，违反可验证性基本定义（ISO/IEC/IEEE 29148:2018明确要求验证必须基于可观察、可测量的行为或状态）；"},
  "suggestions": {"U":"Replace with: 'Every requirement statement in this SRS that begins with the word \"shall\" and expresses a mandatory behavior, property, or constraint of the system is a binding requirement.'","A":"Replace with: 'A requirement is binding if and only if it is a complete sentence whose main verb phrase uses the modal \"shall\" in active voice, present tense, and directly assigns obligation to the system (e.g., \"The system shall validate input\", not \"Shall be validated\").'","C":"Keep unchanged.","V":"Replace with: 'The SRS document shall contain no requirement statement using the word \"shall\" that does not correspond to a testable system behavior, property, or constraint. Each such statement shall be uniquely identified by a requirement ID and mapped to at least one verification method (test, analysis, inspection, or demonstration) documented in Section 7.'"},
  "issues": [
    {"type":"U","evidence":"Only those conditions expressed with the imperative \"shall\" are to be interpreted as binding requirements for this SRS.","rewrite":"Every requirement statement in this SRS that begins with the word \"shall\" and expresses a mandatory behavior, property, or constraint of the system is a binding requirement."},
    {"type":"A","evidence":"Only those conditions expressed with the imperative \"shall\" are to be interpreted as binding requirements for this SRS.","rewrite":"A requirement is binding if and only if it is a complete sentence whose main verb phrase uses the modal \"shall\" in active voice, present tense, and directly assigns obligation to the system (e.g., \"The system shall validate input\", not \"Shall be validated\")."},
    {"type":"V","evidence":"Only those conditions expressed with the imperative \"shall\" are to be interpreted as binding requirements for this SRS.","rewrite":"The SRS document shall contain no requirement statement using the word \"shall\" that does not correspond to a testable system behavior, property, or constraint. Each such statement shall be uniquely identified by a requirement ID and mapped to at least one verification method (test, analysis, inspection, or demonstration) documented in Section 7."}
  ]
}
